##################################
# Building the Android Toolchain #
##################################

If you want to use the make_android_toolchain script, make sure to export the NDK path and other variables to suit your system.

(E.g., "export NDK=<path/to/ndk>")

You can change the value of TARGET_PLATFORM in the script to suit your preferences, PariDroid should work on any version of Android.

If you do change the TARGET_PLATFORM, then make sure to edit default.properties accordingly.

###########################
# Documentation & Support #
###########################

Documentation for building/using PariDroid can be found on the project wiki: https://code.google.com/p/paridroid/w/list

Bug reports, feature requests and everything else should be emailed to: paridroid@gmail.com

